# Notes backend connection. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) if you need to override.
# Values are Metro-inlined into the JS bundle at BUILD time — restart/rebuild
# after edits.
#
# Both services run authless behind the tailnet; the host Caddy proxies them
# same-origin (see docs/Deploy.md), so clients need a URL only:
#
#   web:      no .env needed — defaults to `/sync` and `/blobs/` on the page's
#             own origin, which the dev proxy and the deployed site both serve
#   Android:  REQUIRED at APK build time, since there is no page origin to
#             derive from. Point at the deployed endpoint.
#
# NOTE: these are currently unset in CI, which is why notes do not sync on
# Android — the canvas is local-only there. See docs/Deploy.md.
#EXPO_PUBLIC_SYNC_URL=wss://<host>:<port>/sync
#EXPO_PUBLIC_BLOBS_URL=https://<host>:<port>/blobs/
